OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FIsolated
OL,6,Fheavy showers or thunderstorms are
OL,7,Fpossible this evening. Turning
OL,8,Fincreasingly dry overnight with clear
OL,9,Fperiods. Not as uncomfortably warm as
OL,10,Flast night but remaining rather warm
OL,11,Fand humid, especially in urban areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CSaturday:FVariable cloud and residual
OL,14,Fisolated showers at first but becoming
OL,15,Fdry with sunny spells. Gradually
OL,16,Fturning fresher than recent days with
OL,17,Fa gentle breeze.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
